# Traditional Black and White (`blackwhite`) template

**Template id:** `blackwhite` · **class:** `classic-bw` · **profile:** `classicBoard`

Default Zebbies / club idle board uses this template in **pre-shoutout mode** (`status: default`, `idleCta: true`) — e.g. “Use ShoutOut @ Clubname”.

## Pre-shoutout idle (lower LED current)

When `display-app.js` renders `blackwhite` with `idleCta` / `status: default`, the canvas gets **`classic-bw-idle`**.

| Region | Live patron ShoutOut | Pre-shoutout idle |
|---|---|---|
| Center message panel (`:after` white board) | Light `#fbfdff` gradient | **Black** `#050505`–`#101114` gradient |
| Main board text | Dark `#111318` on light panel | **White** `#f8f8f8` on dark panel |
| Outer sign chrome | Red/black frame (unchanged) | Same |
| FLOQR identity rail | Red/black pill (unchanged) | Same |

**Do not** apply `classic-bw-idle` to approved/live patron ShoutOuts — only idle/default CTA.

### CSS contract (`display.css`)

- `.classic-bw.classic-bw-idle .display-center:after` → dark panel background
- `.classic-bw.classic-bw-idle #displayMain.classic-bw-board` → white text, dark row tint
- `.classic-bw.classic-bw-idle .classic-board-lines b` → white lettering, dark shadow

### JS contract (`display-app.js`)

```js
canvas.classList.toggle("classic-bw-idle", isClassicBoard && isIdleCta);
```

## Live ShoutOut (patron-composed)

- Three-line physical board; uppercase letters only (`cleanBoardText` / `normalizeClassicBoardText`).
- **No emoji** on `blackwhite` — composer uses uppercase + classic normalization; display uses `displayTextRows` with `uppercase: true`.
- 64×48 cap: **48 characters including spaces** (`maxMainCharacters: 48`, `maxCharactersPerLine: 16` × 3 lines).

## Other templates (not `blackwhite`)

- Emoji supported in composer (`glyphCap` / `graphemes`) and on display (`cleanDisplayText`, `displayTextRows` with `uppercase: false`).
- 64×48 `full` + `classicBoard` profiles: `maxMainCharacters: 48` where updated in `shared-data.js`.

